OL,3,GNEWSABryant attacks 'irresponsible'
OL,4,AStormont ministers over budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,7,FBryant has accused the Stormont
OL,8,Fexecutive of having little "financial
OL,9,Faccountability" while also ruling out
OL,10,F"front-loading" extra money the UK
OL,11,Fgovernment is proposing to give over
OL,12,Fthe next three years.
OL,14,FThe executive has not agreed a budget
OL,15,Ffor this year, blaming the UK's
OL,16,Fdevolution funding formula for leaving
OL,17,Fit short.
OL,19,FAdditional funding of about #1.5bn
OL,20,Fwould be released in three tranches,
OL,21,Fwith #525m available this year.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
